IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-DISTILL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 VOCAB-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 STUDENT-RANK        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FIDELITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ACCEL-X10           PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTILL.
    IF VOCAB-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF STUDENT-RANK == 0
        MOVE 8 TO STUDENT-RANK.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 98 TO FIDELITY-PCT.
    MOVE 27 TO ACCEL-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 STUDENT-RANK.
    WEIGHT 30 ACCEL-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
